# Components
- Default to Server Components. Use "use client" only when browser APIs or interactivity are required
- Wrap client components in Suspense with a meaningful fallback
- No enums. Use `as const` objects
- Folder names in kebab-case (e.g., before-after-viewer/)

# Data
- Server-side data fetching prefers the Convex server client
- Client subscriptions use Convex useQuery. Do not poll job status manually
- Validate all user input with Zod before sending to the API

# Styling
- Tailwind utilities only. No inline style except dynamic dimension math
- Follow an 8px spacing grid
- Colors come from design tokens. No hardcoded hex values
